Attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project builds on prior open-source work by the Mazda Connect (MZD
Connect / CMU) modding community. The tweak approaches collected here derive
from and are indebted to:

  * MZD-AIO (All-In-One) and the Trevelopment team
    https://github.com/Trevelopment/MZD-AIO
    The original community installer for MZD Connect tweaks (GPL-3.0).
    ScreenTune is the v74+ continuation of work AIO pioneered on earlier
    firmware; this repository is a separate codebase, not a fork. The
    touch-while-driving patch here derives from AIO's `01_touchscreen-i`
    (the same speed-restriction disable and `Global.AtSpeed` change).

  * CASDK — the Custom Application SDK community
    The custom-application and boot-hook patterns that ND/CMU tweaks build on.

